  "title": "Breaking: Channel Management Removed",
  "summary": "The `channels.stop` method and the `Channel` schema have been completely removed from the Cloud Storage API. This is a breaking change affecting push notification channel management.",
  "details": "The `storage.v1` API no longer supports the `channels.stop` method, which was used to stop watching resources via push notifications. Consequently, the `Channel` schema, including all its properties (`address`, `expiration`, `id`, `kind`, `params`, `payload`, `resourceId`, `resourceUri`, `token`, `type`), has also been removed. Developers relying on this functionality for managing push notification channels will need to update their integrations, as this capability is no longer available.",
